# General typescript rules

- Do not use any unless explicitly instructed otherwise
- Do not type cast to any unless explicitly instructed otherwise
- Avoid type casting as a solution to type errors unless it's absolutely necessary or explicitly instructed otherwise
- Avoid using @ts-expect-error, @ts-ignore, or @ts-nocheck unless absolutely necessary or explicitly instructed otherwise

## Checking your work

- If you've had to make a substantial change to a typescript file, run `bun run tsc --noEmit` or `bun run build` in the app or package directory after completing your changes to confirm your work.
- If you've had to make a substantial change to a shared package (packages/common), run `turbo run build` at the project root
